cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the article and this code repository."
title: "Analysis code for: Grip strength and falls in 114,129 middle-aged and older women across four national cohorts"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a four-cohort study of grip strength and falls in middle-aged and older
  women (CHARLS, ELSA, HRS and SHARE) with design-based survey correction, together with a
  two-sample Mendelian randomisation analysis contrasting an overlapping UK Biobank outcome
  with the independent FinnGen release 12 FALLS endpoint. Includes the quality-check script
  that re-derives every number reported in the manuscript.
authors:
